{"seq":2,"slug":"ast-nodes-and-traversal","title":"AST 节点结构与遍历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/foundations/ast-nodes-and-traversal","wordCount":713,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ast-节点结构与遍历\">AST 节点结构与遍历</h1><p>TypeScript 的 AST 拥有超过 350 种节点类型（<code>SyntaxKind</code> 枚举），每种节点都有严格定义的子节点结构。掌握 AST 的内存布局、节点关系和遍历策略，是编写任何代码分析或变换工具的核心技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeScript AST 中的每个节点都实现了 <code>ts.Node</code> 接口。节点之间通过父子引用形成树状结构，而 <code>SyntaxKind</code> 枚举决定了每个节点的具体语义和子节点结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SF[SourceFile] --&gt; FD[FunctionDeclaration]&#10;    SF --&gt; VS[VariableStatement]&#10;    FD --&gt; ID1[Identifier: add]&#10;    FD --&gt; PL[ParameterList]&#10;    FD --&gt; BK[Block]&#10;    PL --&gt; P1[Parameter: a]&#10;    PL --&gt; P2[Parameter: b]&#10;    P1 --&gt; ID2[Identifier: a]&#10;    P1 --&gt; TN[TypeNode: number]&#10;    BK --&gt; RS[ReturnStatement]&#10;    RS --&gt; BE[BinaryExpression: a + b]\">graph TD\n    SF[SourceFile] --&gt; FD[FunctionDeclaration]\n    SF --&gt; VS[VariableStatement]\n    FD --&gt; ID1[Identifier: add]\n    FD --&gt; PL[ParameterList]\n    FD --&gt; BK[Block]\n    PL --&gt; P1[Parameter: a]\n    PL --&gt; P2[Parameter: b]\n    P1 --&gt; ID2[Identifier: a]\n    P1 --&gt; TN[TypeNode: number]\n    BK --&gt; RS[ReturnStatement]\n    RS --&gt; BE[BinaryExpression: a + b]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>kind</code></td>\n<td><code>SyntaxKind</code></td>\n<td>节点类型标识（350+ 种）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pos</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>起始位置（含前导 trivia）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>end</code></td>\n<td><code>number</code></td>\n<td>结束位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parent</code></td>\n<td><code>Node</code></td>\n<td>父节点引用（需 <code>setParentNodes: true</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flags</code></td>\n<td><code>NodeFlags</code></td>\n<td>节点标志（如 <code>const</code> / <code>let</code> / <code>export</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modifiers</code></td>\n<td><code>NodeArray&lt;ModifierLike&gt;</code></td>\n<td>修饰符列表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"syntaxkind-与类型守卫\">SyntaxKind 与类型守卫</h2><p>TypeScript Compiler API 为每种节点类型都提供了对应的类型守卫函数 <code>ts.isXxx()</code>，它们是你与 AST 交互的主要方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ts from &#39;typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;function visit(node: ts.Node) {&#10;  if (ts.isFunctionDeclaration(node)) {&#10;    // node 的类型已收窄为 ts.FunctionDeclaration&#10;    console.log(&#39;函数名:&#39;, node.name?.text);&#10;    console.log(&#39;参数数量:&#39;, node.parameters.length);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (ts.isCallExpression(node)) {&#10;    // node 的类型已收窄为 ts.CallExpression&#10;    console.log(&#39;调用表达式:&#39;, node.expression.getText());&#10;    console.log(&#39;实参数量:&#39;, node.arguments.length);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  ts.forEachChild(node, visit);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isFunctionDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // node 的类型已收窄为 ts.FunctionDeclaration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'函数名:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node.name?.text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'参数数量:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node.parameters.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isCallExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // node 的类型已收窄为 ts.CallExpression</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'调用表达式:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node.expression.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'实参数量:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, node.arguments.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, visit);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用的节点类型守卫按功能分组：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组</th>\n<th>常用守卫</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明</td>\n<td><code>isVariableDeclaration</code>, <code>isFunctionDeclaration</code>, <code>isClassDeclaration</code>, <code>isInterfaceDeclaration</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达式</td>\n<td><code>isCallExpression</code>, <code>isBinaryExpression</code>, <code>isPropertyAccessExpression</code>, <code>isArrowFunction</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语句</td>\n<td><code>isIfStatement</code>, <code>isReturnStatement</code>, <code>isForStatement</code>, <code>isExpressionStatement</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td><code>isTypeReferenceNode</code>, <code>isUnionTypeNode</code>, <code>isTypeLiteralNode</code>, <code>isArrayTypeNode</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块</td>\n<td><code>isImportDeclaration</code>, <code>isExportDeclaration</code>, <code>isModuleDeclaration</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"遍历策略\">遍历策略</h2><p>TypeScript 提供了三种级别的 AST 遍历方式，适用于不同场景：</p>\n<h3 id=\"ts-foreachchild-浅遍历直接子节点\">ts.forEachChild —— 浅遍历直接子节点</h3><p><code>forEachChild</code> 只遍历一个节点的<strong>直接</strong>子节点。它接受一个回调函数，依次对每个子节点调用。如果回调返回 truthy 值，遍历立即停止并返回该值——这使它可以用于搜索：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 查找源文件中第一个类声明&#10;const firstClass = ts.forEachChild(sourceFile, (node) =&gt; {&#10;  if (ts.isClassDeclaration(node)) return node;&#10;  return undefined;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 查找源文件中第一个类声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> firstClass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sourceFile, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isClassDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"递归遍历-深度优先遍历所有后代\">递归遍历 —— 深度优先遍历所有后代</h3><p>最常用的模式是递归调用 <code>forEachChild</code> 实现深度优先遍历：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function walkTree(node: ts.Node, depth = 0) {&#10;  const indent = &#39;  &#39;.repeat(depth);&#10;  console.log(`${indent}${ts.SyntaxKind[node.kind]}`);&#10;  ts.forEachChild(node, (child) =&gt; walkTree(child, depth + 1));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> walkTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> indent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '  '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(depth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">indent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SyntaxKind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> walkTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child, depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ts-visiteachchild-transformer-专用遍历\">ts.visitEachChild —— Transformer 专用遍历</h3><p><code>visitEachChild</code> 用于 Transformer 场景，它会创建节点的<strong>副本</strong>并替换指定子节点。与 <code>forEachChild</code> 的关键区别在于：<code>forEachChild</code> 是只读遍历，<code>visitEachChild</code> 支持返回新节点来替换旧节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function transformer(context: ts.TransformationContext) {&#10;  return (rootNode: ts.SourceFile) =&gt; {&#10;    function visit(node: ts.Node): ts.Node {&#10;      // 先递归处理子节点&#10;      node = ts.visitEachChild(node, visit, context);&#10;      // 再处理当前节点&#10;      if (ts.isStringLiteral(node)) {&#10;        return context.factory.createStringLiteral(node.text.toUpperCase());&#10;      }&#10;      return node;&#10;    }&#10;    return ts.visitNode(rootNode, visit) as ts.SourceFile;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TransformationContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rootNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> visit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 先递归处理子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">visitEachChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, visit, context);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 再处理当前节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isStringLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.factory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createStringLiteral</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.text.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">visitNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rootNode, visit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"位置信息与-trivia\">位置信息与 Trivia</h2><p>AST 节点的位置信息有一个常见的混淆点：<code>node.pos</code> 包含了前导 trivia（空白、注释），而 <code>node.getStart()</code> 返回去除 trivia 后的实际起始位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 源码: &quot;  /* comment */ const x = 1;&quot;&#10;// node.pos = 0 (包含前导空白和注释)&#10;// node.getStart() = 15 (const 关键字的实际位置)&#10;// node.getEnd() = 28&#10;// node.getText() = &quot;const x = 1;&quot;&#10;// node.getFullText() = &quot;  /* comment */ const x = 1;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 源码: \"  /* comment */ const x = 1;\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node.pos = 0 (包含前导空白和注释)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node.getStart() = 15 (const 关键字的实际位置)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node.getEnd() = 28</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node.getText() = \"const x = 1;\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// node.getFullText() = \"  /* comment */ const x = 1;\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>理解这个区别对编写代码修改工具至关重要：如果你用 <code>pos</code> 来做文本替换，会意外地把前面的注释也吞掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节点标志与修饰符\">节点标志与修饰符</h2><p><code>NodeFlags</code> 包含了节点的语法属性（如变量声明的 <code>const</code>/<code>let</code>/<code>var</code> 区分），而修饰符（modifiers）记录了 <code>export</code>、<code>async</code>、<code>static</code>、<code>readonly</code> 等关键字：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isExportedFunction(node: ts.Node): boolean {&#10;  if (!ts.isFunctionDeclaration(node)) return false;&#10;  return node.modifiers?.some((m) =&gt; m.kind === ts.SyntaxKind.ExportKeyword) ?? false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isExportedFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isFunctionDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.modifiers?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SyntaxKind.ExportKeyword) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TypeScript 5.x 中修饰符的表示方式经历了变更：早期版本使用 <code>node.modifiers</code> 数组，5.0+ 改为 <code>ts.canHaveModifiers(node)</code> + <code>ts.getModifiers(node)</code> 的安全访问模式。编写跨版本兼容代码时需注意这一差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>AST 节点通过 <code>SyntaxKind</code> 标识类型，通过 <code>ts.isXxx()</code> 类型守卫安全访问</li>\n<li><code>forEachChild</code> 用于只读分析，<code>visitEachChild</code> 用于变换场景</li>\n<li><code>pos</code> 包含前导 trivia，<code>getStart()</code> 返回去除 trivia 后的真实位置</li>\n<li>NodeFlags 标识语法属性，Modifiers 标识关键字修饰</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟文档：<a href=\"typechecker-and-symbols\">TypeChecker 与 Symbol 系统</a>——从语法节点跨入语义层，查询类型信息</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../metaprogramming/compile-time-metaprogramming/code-generation\">元编程中的 AST 概念</a>——编译期代码生成的跨语言视角</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AST 节点结构与遍历","id":"ast-节点结构与遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SyntaxKind 与类型守卫","id":"syntaxkind-与类型守卫"},{"level":2,"text":"遍历策略","id":"遍历策略"},{"level":3,"text":"ts.forEachChild —— 浅遍历直接子节点","id":"ts-foreachchild-浅遍历直接子节点"},{"level":3,"text":"递归遍历 —— 深度优先遍历所有后代","id":"递归遍历-深度优先遍历所有后代"},{"level":3,"text":"ts.visitEachChild —— Transformer 专用遍历","id":"ts-visiteachchild-transformer-专用遍历"},{"level":2,"text":"位置信息与 Trivia","id":"位置信息与-trivia"},{"level":2,"text":"节点标志与修饰符","id":"节点标志与修饰符"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"TypeScript 编译管线架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/foundations/compilation-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"TypeChecker 与 Symbol 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/foundations/typechecker-and-symbols"}}